Output raw.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font"
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1040
Set Height 420
Set Padding 22
Set Framerate 30
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Hide
Type "export HOME=$PWD/home COLORTERM=truecolor COLORFGBG='15;0'; unset NO_COLOR; clear; ./confirm-demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 3s
Right
Sleep 3s
Left
Sleep 2s
Right
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2s
